## Sensitivity study (keeper, ships in the annex)

The gate has free parameters; the section-4 claim must be shown robust. Commit a
small companion artifact (CSV + an annex table, or a second small figure) that
sweeps:
- gate threshold tau in {0.0, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3} (discard run if min dimension <= tau),
- indicator set {3 coherence-only, 7 discriminating, 12 all reference-free}.
Reporting per cell: # disqualified, whether it equals the trash floor, and
Spearman(accuracy, reliability). Headline finding to preserve: the floor and the
ordering are stable for the 12-dim gate at low tau; **coherence-only is
insufficient** (it misses one floor model and, pre-0505, mis-rated the as-of
cases) — i.e. the full reference-free conjunction is what does the work. Annex,
not main text.

